ash against $377.7M of debt), and interest cover is thin at 0.8x.","Warning signs: an Altman Z of 0.54 in the distress zone.","The value-trap profile is elevated (55/100); see the breakdown below."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 10.2% over 3 years and 25.8% over 5 years, so growth is decelerating, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 22%).","At current returns, reinvesting 100% of profits supports about 2.1% a year of fundamental growth, too little to drive meaningful growth.","Forward indicators: FFO growth of 22.3% a year over five years.","Capex runs 8.9x depreciation (403.9% of sales), so it is building capacity for future growth.","Its Rule of 40 score is -336, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders own 7.5%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 62%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (5 sales, net $194K sold).","It returns 8.2% a year to shareholders (2.7% in buybacks and 7.2% in dividends).","The share count has grown 9.4% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It pays out 246% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."]},"profile":{"v":"INSUFFICIENT DATA","conv":null,"head":"Not enough data to value it: missing price or fair value.","pros":[],"cons":[],"flags":[],"need":[],"buy_below":null,"vc":null,"med":{"pe":23.8785,"ev_ebitda":16.1705,"pfcf":17.849,"pb":1.3551,"roic":0.0405,"gross_margin":0.5564,"fcf_margin":0.1712,"div_yield":0.0475}},"ticker":"PINE","date":"2026-11-13"}